fs/fscache/read_helper.c:82:2-5: WARNING: Use BUG_ON instead of if conditio=
n followed by BUG.
Please make sure the condition has no side effects (see conditional BUG_ON =
definition in include/asm-generic/bug.h)

 Use BUG_ON instead of a if condition followed by BUG.

Semantic patch information:
 This makes an effort to find cases where BUG() follows an if
 condition on an expression and replaces the if condition and BUG()
 with a BUG_ON having the conditional expression of the if statement
 as argument.

Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/misc/bugon.cocci

Fixes: 6c92415d2d3a ("fscache: Add read helper")
Signed-off-by: kbuild test robot <lkp@intel.com>
